# Development Assignment

## Assignment 1 – Git Repository

### Objective

Create and manage a GitHub repository.

### Tasks

1. Create a repository.
2. Add README.md.
3. Add project files.
4. Commit changes.
5. Push changes to GitHub.

### Commands

git init

git add .

git commit -m "Initial commit"

git push

---

# Assignment 2 – Git Branching

### Objective

Understand feature-based development.

### Tasks

1. Create a feature branch.
2. Add a new feature.
3. Commit changes.
4. Push the branch.
5. Create Pull Request.
6. Review changes.
7. Merge into main.

---

# Assignment 3 – CI

### Objective

Create an automated CI pipeline.

### Pipeline

Code
↓
Build
↓
Test
↓
Result

### Tasks

1. Create GitHub Actions workflow.
2. Trigger workflow on push.
3. Trigger workflow on Pull Request.
4. Validate project files.
5. Check workflow result.

---

# Assignment 4 – Docker

### Objective

Containerize the application.

### Tasks

1. Create Dockerfile.
2. Build Docker image.
3. Run Docker container.
4. Test application.
5. Stop the container.

### Commands

docker build -t devops-app .

docker run -p 8080:80 devops-app

